<title>USA: Lincoln County SD, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Lincoln County SD, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co, Inc said it won $1.685 million of Lincoln County School District, Miss., general obligation school bonds, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.8632 percent.</p>
</text>
